#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:2
msgid "Versions"
msgstr "版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs supports publishing multiple versions of your documentation. "
"This allows your users to read the exact documentation for the specific "
"version of the project they are using."
msgstr "Read the Docs 支持发布文档的多个版本。这让你的用户能阅读与其所用项目版本完全对应的文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:7
msgid "Versioning is useful for many reasons, but a few common use cases are:"
msgstr "版本控制有很多用处，常见场景包括："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:9
msgid "Shipping API client libraries that release versions across time."
msgstr "发布随时间迭代版本的 API 客户端库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:10
msgid ""
"Having a \"stable\" and \"latest\" branch so that users can see the current "
"release and the upcoming changes."
msgstr "同时保留 \"stable\" 和 \"latest\" 分支，让用户既能看当前发布版，也能看到即将到来的变更。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:11
msgid ""
"Having a private development branch and a public stable branch so that in "
"development releases aren't accidentally seen by users until they are "
"released."
msgstr "保留私有开发分支和公开稳定分支，避免开发版在正式发布前被用户意外看到。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:14
msgid "Versions are Git tags and branches"
msgstr "版本即 Git 标签和分支"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:16
msgid ""
"When you add a project to Read the Docs, all Git tags and branches are "
"created as **Inactive** and **Not Hidden** versions by default. During "
"initial setup, Read the Docs also creates a ``latest`` version that points "
"to the default branch defined in your Git repository (usually ``main``). "
"This version should always exist and is the default version for your "
"project."
msgstr ""
"将项目添加到 Read the Docs 时，所有 Git 标签和分支默认创建为**非活跃** 且** 未隐藏** 的版本。在初始设置阶段，Read "
"the Docs 还会创建一个指向 Git 仓库中默认分支（通常为 ``main``）的 ``latest`` "
"版本。该版本应始终存在，且是项目的默认版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:22
msgid ""
"If your project has any tags or branches with a name following `semantic "
"versioning <https://semver.org/>`_ (with or without a ``v`` prefix), we also"
" create a ``stable`` version tracking your greatest stable semantic version "
"number release. It excludes pre-release versions indicated by alphas, betas,"
" and similar unstable notations, according to semantic versioning. If you "
"want a custom ``stable`` version, create either a tag or branch in your "
"project with that name."
msgstr ""
"若项目中有名称遵循 `semantic versioning <https://semver.org/>`_ （带或不带 ``v`` "
"前缀）的标签或分支，我们还会创建一个 ``stable`` 版本，跟踪你最大的稳定语义化版本号发布。按语义化版本规范，它会排除由 alpha、beta "
"等不稳定标记指示的预发布版本。若想自定义 ``stable`` 版本，请在项目中创建同名标签或分支。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you have at least one tag, tags will take preference over branches when "
"selecting the stable version. The comparison uses the tag or branch name "
"from your Git repository, not the version slug shown in URLs."
msgstr "若至少有一个标签，选择稳定版本时标签优先于分支。比较使用 Git 仓库中的标签或分支名，而非 URL 中显示的版本 slug。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:35
msgid ""
"When you have :doc:`/reference/git-integration` configured for your "
"repository, we will automatically build each version when you push a commit."
msgstr "为你的仓库配置 :doc:`/reference/git-integration` 后，推送提交时我们会自动构建每个版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:39
msgid "Version states"
msgstr "版本状态"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:41
msgid ""
"Each version of your documentation has a state that changes the visibility "
"of it to other users."
msgstr "文档的每个版本都有一个状态，决定它对其他用户的可见性。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:43
msgid "**Active** or **Inactive**"
msgstr "**活跃** 或** 非活跃**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Active** docs are visible, and builds can be triggered for the "
"documentation."
msgstr "**活跃** 文档可见，且可触发构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Inactive** versions *have their documentation content deleted* and builds "
"cannot be triggered."
msgstr "**非活跃** 版本*其文档内容会被删除*，且无法触发构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:47
msgid "**Hidden** or **Not hidden**"
msgstr "**隐藏** 或** 未隐藏**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Not hidden** docs are listed on the :term:`flyout menu` on the docs site "
"and are shown in search results."
msgstr "**未隐藏** 文档会列在文档站点的 :term:`flyout menu` 上，并出现在搜索结果中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Hidden** docs are not listed on the :term:`flyout menu` on the docs site "
"and are not shown in search results."
msgstr "**隐藏** 文档不会列在文档站点的 :term:`flyout menu` 上，也不会出现在搜索结果中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:53
msgid ""
"Hiding a version doesn't make it private, any user with a link to its docs "
"can still see it. This is useful when:"
msgstr "隐藏版本不会使其变为私有，任何拥有其文档链接的用户仍可查看。这在以下情况有用："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:57
msgid "You no longer support a version, but you don't want to remove its docs."
msgstr "你不再支持某个版本，但不想删除其文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:58
msgid ""
"You have a work in progress version and don't want to publish its docs just "
"yet."
msgstr "你有进行中的版本，暂时不想发布其文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:60
msgid ""
"Hidden versions are listed as ``Disallow: /path/to/version/`` in the default"
" :doc:`/reference/robots` created by Read the Docs."
msgstr ""
"在 Read the Docs 创建的默认 :doc:`/reference/robots` 中，隐藏版本列为 ``Disallow: "
"/path/to/version/``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:63
msgid "**Public** or **Private** (only available on :doc:`/commercial/index`)"
msgstr "**公开** 或** 私有** （仅 :doc:`/commercial/index` 提供）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Public** versions are visible to everyone, and are browsable by "
"unauthenticated users."
msgstr "**公开** 版本对所有人可见，未认证用户也可浏览。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:65
msgid ""
"**Private** versions are available only to people who have permissions to "
"see them. They will return a `404 Not Found` when visited by people without "
"viewing permissions. If you want to share your docs temporarily, see "
":doc:`/commercial/sharing`."
msgstr ""
"**私有** 版本仅对有查看权限的用户可用。无查看权限的用户访问时会返回 `404 Not Found`。若想临时共享文档，请参阅 "
":doc:`/commercial/sharing`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:69
msgid ""
"If you want unauthenticated people to be able to view the build page of your"
" public versions, you'll need to the set the :doc:`privacy level of your "
"project </commercial/privacy-level>` to public."
msgstr "若希望未认证用户也能查看公开版本的构建页面，需将 :doc:`项目的隐私级别 </commercial/privacy-level>` 设为公开。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:73
msgid "Version syncing"
msgstr "版本同步"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:75
msgid "Versions are automatically synced when the following events happen:"
msgstr "发生以下事件时版本自动同步："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:77
msgid ""
"A commit is pushed to your Git repository and you have a :doc:`Git "
"integration </reference/git-integration>` configured."
msgstr "向 Git 仓库推送提交，且已配置 :doc:`Git 集成 </reference/git-integration>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:78
msgid "A build for any of your version is triggered."
msgstr "任一版本触发构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:80
msgid ""
"If you find that your versions are out of date, triggering a build is the "
"best approach to ensuring they are synced again."
msgstr "若发现版本已过期，触发构建是确保重新同步的最好办法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:84
msgid "Managing your versions"
msgstr "管理版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:86
msgid ""
"When you activate a version, a :doc:`build </builds>` will be triggered to "
"automatically deploy your documentation."
msgstr "激活版本时会触发一次 :doc:`构建 </builds>`，自动部署你的文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:89
msgid ""
"When you deactivate a version, all of the artifacts of your version will be "
"deleted and a ``404 Not Found`` page will be served for it."
msgstr "停用版本时，该版本的所有构建产物都会被删除，并对其提供 ``404 Not Found`` 页面。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:92
msgid ""
"You can change the state for each version of your documentation in your "
"project's :menuselection:`Versions` tab."
msgstr "可在项目的 :menuselection:`Versions` 标签页中更改每个文档版本的状态。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:95
msgid "Version URL identifier (slug)"
msgstr "版本 URL 标识符（slug）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:97
msgid ""
"Each version of your project has a unique URL identifier (slug). This "
"identifier is used to reference the version in your documentation, "
":term:`dashboard`, and :doc:`API </api/index>`."
msgstr ""
"项目的每个版本都有唯一的 URL 标识符（slug）。该标识符用于在文档、:term:`dashboard` 和 :doc:`API "
"</api/index>` 中引用版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:100
msgid ""
"A version slug is automatically generated from the name of the branch or tag"
" in your repository, some special characters like spaces and ``/`` are "
"replaced with a dash (``-``), and the name is lowercased. If the resulting "
"slug collides with another one, a suffix is added (``_a``, ``_b``, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"版本 slug 由仓库中分支或标签名自动生成，空格和 ``/`` 等特殊字符会替换为连字符（``-``），名称转为小写。若生成的 slug "
"与其他冲突，会追加后缀（``_a``、``_b`` 等）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:104
msgid ""
"You can change the slug of a version in :ref:`the versions tab of your "
"project <versions:Managing your versions>`, or with the :ref:`API "
"<api/v3:Version update>`, but you should take the following into account:"
msgstr ""
"可在 :ref:`项目的版本标签页 <versions:Managing your versions>` 或通过 :ref:`API "
"<api/v3:Version update>` 更改版本 slug，但需注意："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:108
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:126
msgid ""
"Changing the slug of an active version will result on its previous "
"documentation being deleted, and a new build being triggered. Be careful "
"when renaming active versions, specially old ones that might not build "
"anymore."
msgstr "更改活跃版本的 slug 会导致其原文档被删除，并触发新构建。重命名活跃版本时请谨慎，尤其是可能已无法构建的旧版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:110
msgid ""
"Any URL referencing your version with the old slug will return a ``404 Not "
"Found`` page. You can use :ref:`an exact redirect <user-defined-"
"redirects:Redirecting an old version to a new one>` to redirect users to the"
" new URL. After changing the slug of an active version, the "
":term:`dashboard` shows a notification with a link to create that redirect, "
"with the form already filled in."
msgstr ""
"任何使用旧 slug 引用该版本的 URL 都会返回 ``404 Not Found`` 页面。可用 :ref:`精确重定向 <user-"
"defined-redirects:Redirecting an old version to a new one>` 将用户导向新 "
"URL。更改活跃版本 slug 后，:term:`dashboard` 会显示带创建重定向链接的通知，表单已预填。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:113
msgid ""
"You may still see the original name of the version in some places, as "
"changing the slug only affects the URL used in your documentation and how "
"the APIs identify that version. `We are considering adding another field to "
"be used for display in the future "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/issues/11979>`__."
msgstr ""
"某些地方你可能仍会看到版本原名，因为更改 slug 只影响文档中使用的 URL 以及 API 标识该版本的方式。`我们正在考虑未来增加一个用于展示的字段"
" <https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/issues/11979>`__。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:116
msgid ""
"Sorting of versions in the version selector is done based on the slug, "
"changing the slug of a version may change the order in which they are shown "
"to your users. `We are considering adding another field to be used for "
"sorting in the future "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/issues/11979>`__."
msgstr ""
"版本选择器中的版本排序基于 slug，更改版本 slug 可能改变向用户展示的顺序。`我们正在考虑未来增加一个用于排序的字段 "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/issues/11979>`__。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:119
msgid ""
"You can't change the slug of versions that are managed by Read the Docs, "
"like ``latest`` and ``stable``."
msgstr "无法更改由 Read the Docs 管理的版本（如 ``latest`` 和 ``stable``）的 slug。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:120
msgid "Slugs must be unique for each version of your project."
msgstr "项目每个版本的 slug 必须唯一。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:121
msgid ""
"The slug can contain lowercase letters, numbers, dashes (``-``), underscores"
" (``_``) and dots (``.``). If you try to use a slug that contains any other "
"character, you'll get an error message with a suggestion of a valid slug."
msgstr ""
"slug 可包含小写字母、数字、连字符（``-``）、下划线（``_``）和点（``.``）。若使用含其他字符的 slug，会收到错误提示并给出有效 "
"slug 建议。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:130
msgid "Disabling versioning completely"
msgstr "完全禁用版本控制"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:132
msgid ""
"You can :doc:`configure a single version project </versioning-schemes>`, and"
" the version will be hidden from the URL."
msgstr "你可以 :doc:`将项目配置为单版本 </versioning-schemes>`，版本号将从 URL 中隐藏。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:136
msgid "Version warning notifications"
msgstr "版本警告通知"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:138
msgid ""
"As part of :doc:`addons`, Read the Docs displays notifications in the "
"following situations:"
msgstr "作为 :doc:`addons` 的一部分，Read the Docs 在以下情况显示通知："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:140
msgid "Non-stable notification"
msgstr "非稳定版本通知"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:141
msgid ""
"A notification on all non-stable versions is shown to clearly communicate to"
" readers they may be reading an outdated version of the documentation."
msgstr "所有非稳定版本上都会显示通知，明确告知读者他们可能正在阅读过时版本的文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:143
msgid ""
"Specifically, when a version is being shown that is not the ``stable`` "
"version, and there is a ``stable`` version available."
msgstr "具体来说，当显示的版本不是 ``stable`` 版本，且存在可用的 ``stable`` 版本时。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:146
msgid "Latest version notification"
msgstr "最新版本通知"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:147
msgid ""
"A notification shown on the latest version tells readers they are reading "
"the latest/development version of the documentation that may include "
"features not yet deployed."
msgstr "最新版本上显示的通知告知读者，他们正在阅读文档的最新/开发版本，其中可能包含尚未部署的功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:149
msgid ""
"Specifically, when the ``latest`` version is being shown, and there's also "
"an active ``stable`` version that is not hidden."
msgstr "具体来说，当显示 ``latest`` 版本，且同时存在未隐藏的活跃 ``stable`` 版本时。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:151
msgid ""
"Each of these notifications can be configured by project admins in "
":ref:`addons:Configuring Read the Docs Addons`."
msgstr "项目管理员可在 :ref:`addons:Configuring Read the Docs Addons` 中配置每个通知。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:154
msgid "Redirects on root URLs"
msgstr "根 URL 重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:156
msgid ""
"When a user hits the root URL for your documentation, for example "
"``https://pip.readthedocs.io/``, they will be redirected to the **Default "
"version**. This defaults to **latest**, but another common configuration is "
"setting it to your **stable** version."
msgstr ""
"当用户访问文档根 URL（如 ``https://pip.readthedocs.io/``）时，会被重定向到**默认版本**。默认是 "
"**latest**，另一常见配置是设为 **stable** 版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:163
msgid "Versioning workflows"
msgstr "版本控制工作流"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:165
msgid ""
"Read the Docs makes certain assumptions about your documentation version "
"defaults, all of which can be reconfigured if necessary:"
msgstr "Read the Docs 对文档版本默认值做了若干假设，必要时均可重新配置："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:168
msgid ""
"The ``latest`` version points to the most up to date development code. If "
"you develop on a branch that is different than the default for your version "
"control system, set the **Default Branch** to the branch you use."
msgstr "``latest`` 版本指向最新的开发代码。若你在与版本控制系统默认分支不同的分支上开发，请将**默认分支** 设为你使用的分支。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:172
msgid ""
"**Tags** are semantic versioning compatible (according to  `PEP 440`_) "
"snapshots of your documentation. The most recent semantic tag maps to the "
"``stable`` version."
msgstr "**标签** 是兼容语义化版本（依 `PEP 440`_）的文档快照。最近的语义化标签对应 ``stable`` 版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:175
msgid ""
"Semantic versioning allows \"normal\" version numbers like ``1.4.2``, as "
"well as pre-releases like this: ``2.0a1``. The ``stable`` version of your "
"documentation never includes a pre-release. An optional ``v`` prefix like "
"``v1.4.2`` or ``v2.0a1`` is also allowed."
msgstr ""
"语义化版本允许 ``1.4.2`` 这样的\"常规\"版本号，也允许 ``2.0a1`` 这样的预发布版本。文档的 ``stable`` "
"版本绝不包含预发布。也允许 ``v1.4.2`` 或 ``v2.0a1`` 这样的可选 ``v`` 前缀。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versions.rst:179
msgid ""
"Branches are assumed to be **long-lived branches**, This is most useful for "
"**release branches**, which are maintained over time for a specific release."
" An example would be a ``2.1`` branch that is kept up to date with the "
"latest ``2.1.x`` release."
msgstr ""
"分支被假定为**长期分支**。这对** 发布分支** 最有用，即为特定发布长期维护的分支。例如 ``2.1`` 分支持续与最新的 ``2.1.x`` "
"发布保持同步。"

